    "content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Request a private itinerary | OSO</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Share your destination, preferences and occasion with OSO to begin planning a private itinerary.\"><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/assets/oso-logo.png\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/style.css\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/booking.css\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/modern.css?v=20261006-concierge\"></head><body style=\"--city-accent:#8a6f72\"><header><a class=\"brand brand-horizontal\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"OSO — Hospitality, Everywhere. Home\"><span class=\"brand-emblem\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/oso-logo.png\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"brand-lettering\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/oso-logo.png\" alt=\"\"></span></a><nav id=\"main-navigation\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/#destinations\">Destinations</a><a href=\"/#approach\">The OSO way</a><a href=\"/#how-it-works\">Your concierge</a></nav><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"/enquire/\">Request a private itinerary</a><button class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"main-navigation\">Menu</button></header>\n<main class=\"private-enquiry\"><section class=\"enquiry-section\" id=\"enquire\"><aside><p class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR PRIVATE ITINERARY</p><h1>It starts with<br><em>a conversation.</em></h1><p>Tell us what you have in mind. Share a few details, and let us know how you would like to experience your destination.</p><a href=\"mailto:osohospitality@gmail.com\">osohospitality@gmail.com</a><p class=\"small-note\">Prefer to get in touch directly?<br><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/osohospitality/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Instagram · @osohospitality</a></p></aside>\n<form action=\"https://formsubmit.co/osohospitality@gmail.com\" method=\"POST\" id=\"enquiry-form\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_subject\" value=\"OSO private itinerary enquiry\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"requested_services\" value=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_template\" value=\"table\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_next\" value=\"https://osohospitality.world/thank-you/\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_autoresponse\" value=\"Thank you for sharing your plans with OSO. We look forward to discussing your preferences and the possibilities for your visit. Your enquiry is a request, not a confirmed reservation. For anything further, contact osohospitality@gmail.com. OSO — Hospitality, Everywhere.\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"_honey\" class=\"honeypot\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<fieldset><legend>What may we arrange? <span>(select one or more)</span></legend><div class=\"service-choices\"><label class=\"service-choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"services\" value=\"Stays\"><span>Stays</span></label><label class=\"service-choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"services\" value=\"Car rentals\"><span>Car rentals</span></label><label class=\"service-choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"services\" value=\"Yacht rentals\"><span>Yacht rentals</span></label><label class=\"service-choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"services\" value=\"Nightlife\"><span>Nightlife</span></label><label class=\"service-choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"services\" value=\"Restaurants\"><span>Restaurants</span></label><label class=\"service-choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"services\" value=\"Events &amp; experiences\"><span>Events &amp; experiences</span></label></div><p id=\"service-error\" class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden>Please select at least one service.</p></fieldset>\n<div class=\"form-grid\"><label>Destination <span>*</span><select name=\"destination\" required><option value=\"\">Choose a destination</option><option>Venice</option><option>Paris</option><option>London</option><option>Milan</option><option>Tokyo</option><option>Singapore</option><option>Dubai</option><option>New York</option><option>Miami</option><option>Mexico City</option><option>Cape Town</option><option>Sydney</option><option>Several destinations</option><option>I would like your guidance</option></select></label><label>The occasion <span>(optional)</span><select name=\"occasion\"><option value=\"\">Select an occasion</option><option>A personal escape</option><option>A celebration</option><option>A honeymoon or anniversary</option><option>Business &amp; leisure</option><option>An event or festival</option><option>Something else</option></select></label><label>Preferred contact method<select name=\"contact_method\" id=\"contact-method\"><option>Email</option><option>WhatsApp</option><option>Phone call</option></select></label><label>Full name <span>*</span><input name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" required maxlength=\"120\"></label><label>Email address <span>*</span><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required maxlength=\"254\"></label><label>Phone / WhatsApp <span>(optional)</span><input type=\"tel\" name=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\" maxlength=\"40\" placeholder=\"Include country code\"></label><label>Number of guests <span>*</span><input type=\"number\" name=\"guests\" min=\"1\" max=\"500\" required value=\"2\"></label><label>Preferred start date <span>*</span><input type=\"date\" name=\"start_date\" required></label><label>End date <span>(optional)</span><input type=\"date\" name=\"end_date\"></label><label>Preferred time <span>(optional)</span><input type=\"time\" name=\"preferred_time\"></label><label>Budget & currency <span>(optional)</span><input name=\"budget\" maxlength=\"100\" placeholder=\"e.g. USD 2,000 total\"></label></div>\n<label class=\"message-label\">What would make this visit yours? <span>(optional)</span><textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"5\" maxlength=\"5000\" placeholder=\"Your ideal pace, favourite restaurants, preferred style of stay, wish-list experiences, or any details you would like us to consider.\"></textarea></label>\n<label class=\"consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"contact_consent\" value=\"Agreed\" required><span>I agree to share these details with OSO via FormSubmit and be contacted about this enquiry. <a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy details</a></span></label>\n<button class=\"dark-button\" type=\"submit\">Request my private itinerary</button><p class=\"small-note\">Your enquiry is a first conversation, not a confirmed reservation. Please leave payment and passport details out of this form.</p><p class=\"small-note\">If you have trouble submitting, <a href=\"mailto:osohospitality@gmail.com?subject=OSO%20private%20itinerary%20enquiry\">email us directly</a>.</p>\n</form></section></main><footer><a class=\"footer-wordmark\" href=\"/\">OSO</a><div><p>HOSPITALITY, EVERYWHERE.</p><span>osohospitality.world</span></div><a href=\"/#approach\">Our philosophy</a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/osohospitality/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"OSO Hospitality on Instagram (opens in a new tab)\">Instagram · @osohospitality</a><a href=\"mailto:osohospitality@gmail.com\">Contact OSO</a><a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy</a><span class=\"copyright\">© <span id=\"year\"></span> OSO</span></footer>\n<script src=\"/booking.js?v=20261006-concierge\"></script><script src=\"/slideshow.js\"></script><script src=\"/modern.js\"></script></body></html>"
